@startuml

title Idempotent Receiver: a second delivery of the same step has no further effect

start
:a step command arrives (step id S);
:ask the engine to replay the outcome of S;
if (an outcome is recorded?) then (yes)
  :publish the recorded outcome;
  note right: no work is done again
  stop
else (no, or the replay timed out)
endif
:do the work with converging writes;
note right
  a write keyed on stable business data:
  a repeat meets its own earlier effect
  and leaves the same end state
end note
:publish the completion for S;
note right: the engine drops a completion\nfor a step no longer in progress
stop
@enduml
